      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 841519214989314
    m_Localized: USE THE RINGS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 841519214989315
    m_Localized: Jump off the ramp through the ring to charge it. Once charged, it
      spins and floods the area with your color. If a rival crosses it, they remove
      a charge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 841519214989316
    m_Localized: WIN THE TERRITORY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 841519214989317
    m_Localized: When time runs out, the team with the most painted floor wins. A
      tie means a tiebreaker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 841519214989318
    m_Localized: WAITING FOR PLAYERS {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 841519214989319
    m_Localized: ALL READY! STARTING IN {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267884781568
    m_Localized: LOADING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918912
    m_Localized: LOADED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918913
    m_Localized: READY!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918914
    m_Localized: WAITING FOR OTHERS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918915
    m_Localized: LEAVE? PRESS AGAIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918916
    m_Localized: TIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918917
    m_Localized: 'Hold your drift longer: the boost is stronger when you let go.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918918
    m_Localized: You accelerate faster on your own paint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918919
    m_Localized: 'A direct hit stuns your rival: they can''t accelerate or paint
      for a moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918920
    m_Localized: 'Grab barrels and drop them in your rival''s path: they blow up
      when driven over.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918921
    m_Localized: A barrel blast slows down everyone caught nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918922
    m_Localized: Stuck or flipped? Hold Respawn to get back on track.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918923
    m_Localized: Stealing enemy paint also adds to your score.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851267930918924
    m_Localized: 'Guard your rings: every rival who crosses one takes away a charge.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
